# Vuetify density

Do **not** pass `density="default"` on fields or components. Vuetify already uses default density.

If a field looks too compact, fix the component default. Do not override `density="default"` at the call site.

```html
<!-- ❌ BAD -->
<c-lazy-search-field density="default" />
<external-data-table-table-field density="default" />

<!-- ✅ GOOD -->
<c-lazy-search-field />
<external-data-table-table-field />
```
